{"id": "EUVD-2026-81721", "enisaUuid": "cfc1bd25-3f96-3734-b75b-db3776784ab1", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nvdpa/mlx5: fix wrong list iterated in add_direct_chain error path\n\nIn add_direct_chain(), newly allocated direct MR entries are added to\nthe local list 'tmp', which is spliced into mr->head only on success.\nOn the error path, the cleanup loop was incorrectly iterating over\nmr->head instead of tmp.\n\nFix by iterating over 'tmp' in the err_alloc cleanup path.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:06:29", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:58:26", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c93defccf5eb0a92bdafa43487be6ce0221a2477", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ed3462365636df3bc63e34d7468f4faed3f70a4e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/22d52af9e26a72bdfe2dcfb1419a091de4862cd9", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eeac2ea4ad2654e3f160a9b608d05c9af31433a6", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/637d867530daea61898e3346975978b7f67fc2ac", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6ca752850de3b8162f030793cc15001aec85c4cf", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c678d04ac9e5a64c2559c43bce273e845fbd09eb", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/23ae56d9e74c122f95cae71ae3b9fc259fb88446"], "aliases": ["GHSA-578j-pcj4-7hf3", "CVE-2026-90128"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "011fe689-a643-3347-a846-0b2ac0b6b015", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "94abbccdf2916cb03f9626f2d36c6e9971490c12 <c93defccf5eb0a92bdafa43487be6ce0221a2477"}, {"id": "2e61d175-b191-3583-a370-dc40eacd5812", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "94abbccdf2916cb03f9626f2d36c6e9971490c12 <ed3462365636df3bc63e34d7468f4faed3f70a4e"}, {"id": "2f171952-cf5c-30f0-89f0-60b234c5f40f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "94abbccdf2916cb03f9626f2d36c6e9971490c12 <eeac2ea4ad2654e3f160a9b608d05c9af31433a6"}, {"